WEBVTT

01:49.300 --> 01:54.930
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.039 --> 01:58.009
[Episode 36]

01:59.150 --> 01:59.950
Nan Heng,

02:00.870 --> 02:03.790
the script world is governed
by certain rules.

02:04.120 --> 02:06.040
Apart from the two you know,

02:06.040 --> 02:07.120
there are two more.

02:07.480 --> 02:08.280
One is

02:08.560 --> 02:10.259
about how I get back to where I'm from.

02:10.259 --> 02:11.590
As long as Song Yimeng and you

02:11.590 --> 02:12.870
finish all the iconic scenes

02:12.870 --> 02:13.870
till the finale,

02:13.870 --> 02:15.280
I'll be brought back to the modern times.

02:15.280 --> 02:16.760
The other one is,

02:20.120 --> 02:21.940
changes of iconic scenes will backfire

02:21.940 --> 02:23.400
on those who induce them.

02:25.220 --> 02:27.180
[Trouble finds those
who change the iconic scenes]

02:27.960 --> 02:28.970
Backfire?

02:31.450 --> 02:32.640
Then Song Yimeng...

02:32.660 --> 02:33.590
She'll be fine.

02:33.910 --> 02:34.770
Think about it.

02:34.870 --> 02:36.070
What has she changed?

02:36.870 --> 02:38.079
She did fall into the water
in the royal garden

02:38.079 --> 02:39.070
as the script says.

02:39.070 --> 02:40.400
She was rescued by a hero
at the Lantern Festival

02:40.400 --> 02:41.280
as the script says.

02:41.280 --> 02:42.630
She did defy the Song family

02:42.630 --> 02:43.650
as the script says.

02:43.650 --> 02:46.030
She even caught you
in bed with Song Yiting

02:46.030 --> 02:47.590
as the script says.

02:47.590 --> 02:49.130
The only change happened

02:49.240 --> 02:50.430
on the wedding day,

02:50.430 --> 02:52.079
when you used the script rules

02:52.079 --> 02:53.630
to break the script rules.

02:54.340 --> 02:55.400
So, Nan Heng,

02:56.290 --> 02:57.950
in the script world,

02:58.400 --> 03:00.060
you're the only one character

03:00.280 --> 03:02.470
who can change the iconic scenes.

03:08.310 --> 03:09.150
That's good.

03:09.150 --> 03:09.750
Good?

03:11.520 --> 03:12.560
If the upcoming plots go

03:12.560 --> 03:15.150
further and further
into the opposite direction--

03:15.150 --> 03:17.800
for example, Song Yiting
marries Shangguan He--

03:17.800 --> 03:20.200
then you,
who induced the initial changes,

03:20.680 --> 03:22.010
will be hurt even worse,

03:22.430 --> 03:23.710
till you die.

03:24.079 --> 03:24.870
Understood?

03:26.600 --> 03:29.030
So this is why you helped
to forge a marital union

03:29.030 --> 03:30.760
between Song Yiting and Shangguan He?

03:30.760 --> 03:31.520
Hold on.

03:32.360 --> 03:33.520
What did he tell you?

03:34.520 --> 03:35.610
My uncle said,

03:35.960 --> 03:38.290
based on his years of study on storybooks,

03:38.300 --> 03:40.050
only an external force was needed to

03:40.050 --> 03:42.000
compel Shangguan He
to express his love for Yiting,

03:42.000 --> 03:42.840
and that I was

03:44.240 --> 03:45.520
this force.

03:47.690 --> 03:49.690
I didn't mean to be this cruel to you,

03:50.180 --> 03:52.260
but Song Yimeng stubbornly

03:52.290 --> 03:54.350
refused to play along with the plots.

03:55.060 --> 03:56.240
Nan Heng,

03:56.710 --> 03:58.430
take my advice.

03:59.360 --> 04:00.960
If you want to stay alive,

04:00.960 --> 04:02.280
then just abide by

04:02.280 --> 04:03.940
the rules of the script world.

04:06.280 --> 04:08.380
If I had ever played by the book,

04:08.960 --> 04:11.020
how could you have been brought here?

04:14.440 --> 04:16.510
Still acting tough, aren't you?

04:17.170 --> 04:18.610
To be honest,

04:18.680 --> 04:20.680
if you still try to change the story,

04:20.870 --> 04:21.920
you will die

04:21.940 --> 04:23.180
in less than a month.

04:24.240 --> 04:25.410
When that happens,

04:26.600 --> 04:28.800
how do you think I will hurt Song Yimeng?

04:29.430 --> 04:31.120
Or maybe I should just wait

04:32.150 --> 04:33.780
till you die, huh?

04:48.510 --> 04:49.470
Chu Guihong.

04:51.120 --> 04:53.050
Do you know who you are protecting?

04:54.260 --> 04:56.790
Someone who can help me
return to the capital.

04:56.830 --> 04:58.310
It's my father, of course.

04:59.240 --> 05:00.580
Would your father ever

05:01.070 --> 05:02.430
behave like this?

05:03.190 --> 05:03.870
Open your eyes and look...

05:03.870 --> 05:04.600
Nan Heng,

05:05.000 --> 05:08.260
people would only believe
what's in their best interests.

05:08.510 --> 05:09.950
I'm no exception.

05:14.040 --> 05:15.500
This is what you taught me.

05:16.510 --> 05:18.240
Those who are seen as villains

05:18.240 --> 05:19.680
will be praised for doing

05:19.680 --> 05:21.070
just one good deed.

05:22.680 --> 05:23.630
Now, Miss Song Yiting

05:23.630 --> 05:25.430
and Shangguan He are engaged.

05:26.190 --> 05:27.880
It was my father who helped to make

05:27.880 --> 05:28.890
this beautiful thing happen.

05:28.890 --> 05:29.690
And you...

05:31.720 --> 05:34.720
You're just a loser who's slowly dying.

05:41.659 --> 05:42.540
Dad,

05:44.480 --> 05:45.570
the wind is rising.

05:48.050 --> 05:49.400
Let's go.

06:45.960 --> 06:46.720
You...

06:47.630 --> 06:50.030
I already had Rong Hua
figure out the truth.

06:50.270 --> 06:51.400
At Pingrong Battle,

06:52.000 --> 06:53.950
my father was indeed killed
by Heyuan people.

06:53.950 --> 06:55.550
He had no chance of survival.

06:57.040 --> 06:57.830
Confess now.

06:58.580 --> 07:00.070
Who really are you?

07:00.630 --> 07:01.630
What does "character" mean?

07:01.630 --> 07:02.870
What is "the script world"?

07:02.870 --> 07:03.510
Also,

07:04.870 --> 07:05.750
who am I?

07:12.270 --> 07:13.070
Jixiang,

07:13.430 --> 07:14.800
did you see?

07:14.950 --> 07:17.430
Even Uncle couldn't formally conclude
the long overdue engagement

07:17.430 --> 07:19.240
between Yiting and He.

07:19.240 --> 07:20.430
But I had it done

07:20.430 --> 07:21.630
at my first attempt.

07:22.120 --> 07:24.830
I really am Cupid in human form.

07:26.310 --> 07:28.000
Your Highness, you don't have to talk

07:28.000 --> 07:29.270
when you feel upset.

07:29.720 --> 07:31.160
What's the matter with you?

07:31.160 --> 07:32.000
Y-Y-You...

07:32.000 --> 07:33.430
D-Don't call out my lie.

07:33.560 --> 07:34.480
Your Highness!

07:37.190 --> 07:38.040
Yiting?

07:38.680 --> 07:39.810
Why are you out here?

07:50.000 --> 07:51.510
Why did you help me

07:51.680 --> 07:53.740
in the Waning River Crescent's Hall?

07:55.950 --> 07:56.750
Yiting,

07:57.560 --> 08:00.070
though it was Uncle's request
for help that brought me here,

08:00.070 --> 08:01.710
I did mean to do you a favor.

08:07.780 --> 08:09.440
Actually, during these days,

08:09.950 --> 08:11.480
I've done a lot of thinking.

08:12.510 --> 08:14.440
It's time I stopped pestering you,

08:14.800 --> 08:17.000
since you're way out of my league.

08:18.390 --> 08:19.970
What do you mean?

08:25.480 --> 08:26.180
Yiting,

08:27.510 --> 08:29.120
no other girls in the capital...

08:29.120 --> 08:29.920
No.

08:30.270 --> 08:32.789
No other girls in Great Jing
are better than you.

08:32.789 --> 08:34.549
You have your own insights on everything.

08:34.549 --> 08:36.870
You dare to go against conventions.

08:37.510 --> 08:38.510
But what about me?

08:39.440 --> 08:40.500
I'm just a silly boy

08:41.080 --> 08:43.100
who has no opinions of his own

08:43.320 --> 08:45.580
and hides behind his father all the time.

08:45.670 --> 08:46.840
I'm neither knowledgeable,

08:46.840 --> 08:47.840
nor astute

08:48.000 --> 08:48.960
in politics.

08:49.720 --> 08:51.250
I'm not good enough for you.

08:51.720 --> 08:53.270
After thinking that through,

08:53.270 --> 08:54.730
I actually felt relieved.

08:56.550 --> 08:59.870
Now, I wish you and Shangguan He

09:00.200 --> 09:01.510
a happy marriage.

09:02.750 --> 09:04.440
Thanks for your blessings.

09:04.910 --> 09:06.040
But, Your Highness,

09:06.270 --> 09:08.270
you shouldn't sell yourself short.

09:08.910 --> 09:11.040
Academic and political achievements

09:11.150 --> 09:13.150
aren't enough to define a man.

09:14.030 --> 09:16.510
Similarly, a woman shouldn't be judged

09:16.600 --> 09:18.910
by her temperament
and marriage status.

09:19.960 --> 09:21.960
Your Highness
was born into the royal family,

09:21.960 --> 09:23.330
yet you're pure of heart

09:23.390 --> 09:24.320
and kind.

09:24.790 --> 09:27.360
Not everyone can be like you.

09:27.770 --> 09:28.700
You are cheerful

09:28.840 --> 09:29.700
and outspoken.

09:30.270 --> 09:32.110
These traits are as valuable

09:32.550 --> 09:34.010
and priceless as academic

09:34.120 --> 09:35.780
and political achievements.

09:36.150 --> 09:37.680
So, I believe Your Highness

09:38.000 --> 09:39.320
will find a girl you love,

09:39.320 --> 09:41.030
who truly loves you back.

09:41.600 --> 09:42.150
Thanks.

09:45.790 --> 09:46.480
Yiting.

09:47.790 --> 09:48.670
Wait.

09:48.690 --> 09:51.480
Did you say that because I'm stupid?

09:53.360 --> 09:54.870
Your Highness is not stupid at all.

09:54.870 --> 09:56.470
You're a man of great wisdom.

09:57.510 --> 09:59.840
You reflect on yourself
without others' reminders.

09:59.840 --> 10:01.570
You're tolerant and generous.

10:02.480 --> 10:04.810
You dropped a grudge
that lasted for ten-odd years,

10:04.810 --> 10:06.260
and peacefully accepted

10:06.320 --> 10:08.720
that your brother became the crown prince.

10:09.340 --> 10:11.240
You also kindly helped a girl
fight for her true love,

10:11.240 --> 10:13.240
though she had rejected you before.

10:14.240 --> 10:15.300
Not everyone

10:15.480 --> 10:18.150
is capable of doing these.

10:25.020 --> 10:25.830
Right.

10:26.440 --> 10:27.370
I always know it.

10:28.150 --> 10:30.750
I’m still the remarkable chosen one,

10:30.960 --> 10:32.620
who symbolizes good fortune.

10:38.030 --> 10:39.080
Well, Yiting,

10:39.240 --> 10:40.030
will you

10:41.200 --> 10:44.030
be friends with me,
the man standing for

10:44.060 --> 10:45.160
auspiciousness?

10:46.790 --> 10:48.450
It'll be my honor to be friends

10:48.480 --> 10:49.610
with Your Highness.

10:50.560 --> 10:51.920
That's great.

10:56.840 --> 10:58.290
I've told you the gist.

10:58.510 --> 11:00.100
In the script world,

11:00.440 --> 11:01.840
Nan Heng is the male lead.

11:01.840 --> 11:04.720
He will kill his brother
and ascend the throne at last.

11:04.720 --> 11:06.520
As for you, the cannon fodder...

11:08.670 --> 11:10.120
I mean the second male lead.

11:10.120 --> 11:11.880
You will be killed by Nan Heng

11:12.080 --> 11:14.000
and completely vanish

11:14.030 --> 11:16.480
after he becomes the Emperor.

11:30.240 --> 11:31.840
He has done tons of evil,

11:32.670 --> 11:34.270
including causing my father's death

11:34.270 --> 11:35.930
and stealing my fiancée away.

11:38.360 --> 11:40.620
He'll even tread me under foot in the end?

11:42.360 --> 11:43.270
Why?

11:44.720 --> 11:46.320
Because he's the male lead.

11:48.220 --> 11:49.280
Then what about me?

11:49.730 --> 11:51.420
Why can't I be the protagonist?

11:51.420 --> 11:52.390
How am I inferior to him?

11:52.390 --> 11:53.630
Y-Y-You...

11:53.650 --> 11:55.050
You're not inferior to him.

11:55.050 --> 11:57.290
W-W-Well...

11:57.910 --> 11:58.720
How about...

11:58.720 --> 11:59.670
How about this?

12:01.080 --> 12:02.150
If you play along

12:02.790 --> 12:05.550
with the plot of choosing
one out of the two hostages,

12:05.550 --> 12:07.480
I'll change the ending

12:07.750 --> 12:09.850
w-when I'm back to the modern times.

12:10.030 --> 12:11.670
I'll make you the male lead!

12:23.840 --> 12:25.260
As it turns out,

12:25.720 --> 12:27.720
you'd like to make a deal with me.

12:28.600 --> 12:29.810
Do you know

12:30.910 --> 12:32.360
what I want now?

12:33.790 --> 12:34.840
Of course I do.

12:35.550 --> 12:37.440
You want to kill Nan Heng

12:37.670 --> 12:40.670
and help your cousin Nan Rui
ascend the throne, right?

12:45.320 --> 12:47.200
I do want Nan Heng dead.

12:48.540 --> 12:50.600
But I also want to hold my fate

12:50.940 --> 12:52.410
in my own hands.

12:55.580 --> 12:57.360
In this vast world,

12:58.550 --> 13:00.410
nobody can constrain me anymore.

13:03.440 --> 13:05.640
You want to ascend the throne yourself?

13:16.250 --> 13:17.310
What are you doing?

13:19.080 --> 13:19.680
You...

13:20.270 --> 13:21.730
Don't do anything stupid.

13:28.360 --> 13:30.160
What exactly are you going to do?

13:30.910 --> 13:33.240
If you are to make a deal with me,

13:34.910 --> 13:36.140
meet me in two hours

13:36.870 --> 13:38.240
in Qianyu Mansion.

13:42.660 --> 13:43.440
How am I supposed

13:43.440 --> 13:44.500
to go back this way?

13:45.600 --> 13:46.390
You're sick!

13:47.630 --> 13:48.630
You make me sick!

13:50.120 --> 13:50.840
I didn't

13:50.840 --> 13:53.040
portray him as a crazy guy in the script.

13:56.190 --> 13:57.950
[Iconic Scenes in the Script]

13:58.020 --> 14:01.350
[No. 6: The classic--
choosing to save one
out of the two hostages on the city tower]

14:02.480 --> 14:05.610
Heng suffered a lot
in the cold palace when he was little.

14:05.670 --> 14:08.440
He then spent years
on the dangerous battlefield.

14:06.940 --> 14:16.990
[Moral Cultivation]

14:09.000 --> 14:11.930
Now, he has finally
come back alive from the borders.

14:12.320 --> 14:14.840
His life has just become safer and better.

14:14.840 --> 14:17.370
How did this misfortune
suddenly befall him?

14:23.150 --> 14:24.950
I've ordered an investigation.

14:25.000 --> 14:26.200
Song Yude said,

14:26.480 --> 14:29.630
when the servants in the Song Residence
discovered Heng,

14:29.630 --> 14:31.000
he had sunk into a coma.

14:31.600 --> 14:33.550
Nobody was around him.

14:34.840 --> 14:35.530
Your Majesty.

14:35.530 --> 14:36.390
Your Ladyship.

14:37.240 --> 14:38.030
Your Majesty.

14:38.030 --> 14:38.890
Your Ladyship.

14:39.200 --> 14:41.420
The royal physicians have rushed
to the crown prince's residence.

14:41.420 --> 14:43.630
They said His Highness
had a medical emergency.

14:43.630 --> 14:45.910
Physician Qin is performing
acupuncture on His Highness now.

14:45.910 --> 14:47.670
There will be results soon.

14:49.870 --> 14:50.670
Yes.

14:53.720 --> 14:54.760
Don't worry.

14:55.320 --> 14:57.200
Heng is a blessed child.

14:57.600 --> 14:59.000
He'll surely get better.

15:03.870 --> 15:06.840
His unfortunate life is attributed to me,

15:08.510 --> 15:10.440
his useless mother.

15:12.260 --> 15:13.860
The biggest regret of my life

15:14.480 --> 15:16.740
is not being a good enough mother to Heng.

15:17.790 --> 15:18.840
It is I

15:20.000 --> 15:20.930
who owe him a lot,

15:22.720 --> 15:23.630
not you.

15:43.600 --> 15:45.600
Do you ever plan to tell me the truth?

15:46.600 --> 15:49.000
You used to deceive me
with two identities.

15:49.150 --> 15:51.210
Now, you've been seriously wounded.

15:52.000 --> 15:54.080
Why are you still withholding the truth?

15:54.080 --> 15:54.320
I...

15:54.320 --> 15:55.870
Seeing me act like a fool

15:55.870 --> 15:57.080
and worried sick about you,

15:57.080 --> 15:58.080
are you happy?

15:58.080 --> 15:59.200
Is it fun to you?

16:00.670 --> 16:01.480
I...

16:01.630 --> 16:02.440
I'm not...

16:04.030 --> 16:05.430
I just haven't recovered

16:06.360 --> 16:07.600
from being stabbed twice

16:07.600 --> 16:08.670
on our wedding day.

16:08.820 --> 16:10.340
Why are you still lying?

16:10.960 --> 16:11.960
Physician Qin has told me

16:11.960 --> 16:12.750
that your wounds this time

16:12.750 --> 16:15.550
are completely different
from the previous ones.

16:18.930 --> 16:20.530
I'll tell you the truth then.

16:23.910 --> 16:24.910
I was attacked...

16:25.320 --> 16:26.180
by Lord Qianyu.

16:28.760 --> 16:29.950
Lord Qianyu?

16:31.870 --> 16:33.330
Did he meet you in private?

16:34.000 --> 16:35.200
He failed to persuade you,

16:35.200 --> 16:36.460
so he came to talk to me.

16:36.760 --> 16:39.820
I refused to collaborate
and play along with the plots,

16:40.150 --> 16:42.250
so he poisoned me,

16:42.360 --> 16:44.490
trying to coerce me into a concession.

16:47.510 --> 16:48.550
That means

16:48.750 --> 16:50.210
there's poison in you now?

16:53.270 --> 16:54.390
Where is the antidote?

16:54.390 --> 16:55.790
Does Lord Qianyu have it?

16:57.200 --> 16:58.800
I've attained the antidote.

16:59.750 --> 17:01.480
I'll recover in just a few days.

17:03.440 --> 17:04.069
You...

17:06.579 --> 17:08.579
Do you really have the antidote now?

17:10.790 --> 17:12.190
Are you lying to me or not?

17:12.440 --> 17:13.240
I'm not.

17:16.230 --> 17:16.960
Well,

17:16.960 --> 17:19.240
I'd better ask Physician Qin about it.

17:19.270 --> 17:20.300
Come back!

17:20.680 --> 17:21.589
The scriptwriter is here.

17:21.589 --> 17:22.829
This is a secret.

17:23.200 --> 17:24.400
Letting it out won't do

17:24.400 --> 17:25.450
any good.

17:25.480 --> 17:26.750
Besides, think about this.

17:26.750 --> 17:28.270
I'm the male lead he created.

17:28.270 --> 17:30.330
He won't let me die so easily, will he?

17:30.350 --> 17:31.310
He's just punishing me

17:31.310 --> 17:32.890
for refusing to cooperate

17:33.030 --> 17:33.830
and

17:33.830 --> 17:35.240
to go through the plots.

17:42.510 --> 17:44.400
Is that all?

17:44.590 --> 17:45.510
Nothing else?

17:46.830 --> 17:47.640
Nothing.

17:55.310 --> 17:56.460
Then tell me.

17:56.960 --> 17:59.000
In the Waning River Crescent's Hall,

17:59.000 --> 18:00.350
why did he try so hard to fix

18:00.350 --> 18:01.880
Yiting and Shangguan He up?

18:03.550 --> 18:05.310
If Song Yiting marries Shangguan He,

18:05.310 --> 18:07.830
then you, who induced the initial changes,

18:08.110 --> 18:09.620
will be hurt even worse,

18:09.920 --> 18:11.470
till you die.

18:11.640 --> 18:12.440
Understood?

18:13.750 --> 18:14.550
I think

18:15.310 --> 18:17.970
he was roping Shangguan He
and the Nightwalkers

18:18.000 --> 18:19.270
into fighting me.

18:20.440 --> 18:21.570
Is he stupid or what?

18:21.880 --> 18:24.680
What makes he think
Shangguan He would betray you?

18:25.590 --> 18:28.000
He just assumes everyone here is naive.

18:28.800 --> 18:30.530
You and I won’t obey him.

18:30.590 --> 18:33.450
Shangguan He
will definitely not betray us either.

18:40.000 --> 18:40.900
Nan Heng,

18:41.720 --> 18:42.790
you must promise me

18:43.640 --> 18:44.750
that from now on,

18:45.440 --> 18:47.770
you won't keep your plans from me anymore.

18:48.830 --> 18:51.030
If I ever find you have lied to me again,

18:51.790 --> 18:52.720
I'll condemn you

18:53.270 --> 18:54.720
to eternal punishment.

18:57.270 --> 18:58.070
Got it.

18:59.200 --> 19:00.350
You have my word.

19:10.160 --> 19:11.070
What is it now?

19:12.210 --> 19:13.810
I'll feed you medicine soup.

19:26.550 --> 19:27.590
Why that smile?

19:28.780 --> 19:31.310
You're feeding me medicine
from a small bowl.

19:31.880 --> 19:33.240
I'm adapting to it.

19:36.160 --> 19:36.800
This...

19:44.070 --> 19:44.880
Come on.

19:45.240 --> 19:46.170
Open your mouth.

19:54.830 --> 19:55.640
Here it goes.

19:56.110 --> 19:57.000
Dear,

19:57.240 --> 19:58.500
eat the medicine soup.

20:00.070 --> 20:01.400
Slow down. Easy with it.

20:06.550 --> 20:08.350
I didn't realize until recently

20:08.480 --> 20:10.610
that Your Grace is from another world.

20:10.960 --> 20:13.360
You've not only spared me from death,

20:13.510 --> 20:16.550
but also advanced my relationship
with my beloved woman.

20:16.550 --> 20:17.680
I'm grateful

20:18.000 --> 20:20.000
for Your Grace's generosity.

20:25.440 --> 20:27.170
How come it seems to me

20:27.400 --> 20:29.330
that you have a different purpose?

20:33.110 --> 20:35.710
Nothing can escape
Your Grace's observation.

20:36.200 --> 20:37.030
You see,

20:37.110 --> 20:39.000
tiny story characters

20:39.000 --> 20:41.110
can't hold a candle to gods, can they?

20:41.680 --> 20:42.780
I'm here today

20:42.960 --> 20:44.560
to show fealty to Your Grace.

20:44.590 --> 20:45.560
If Your Grace

20:45.790 --> 20:48.260
deigns to let me join you
in your future action,

20:48.260 --> 20:51.410
I promise I'll be at your disposal.

20:53.790 --> 20:56.840
"Deign" is too strong a word
to be used here.

20:56.920 --> 20:58.000
Despite my poor choice of words,

20:58.000 --> 20:59.530
I do mean everything I said.

21:11.880 --> 21:14.270
You're working to get the storyline
back on the right track.

21:14.270 --> 21:15.440
How may I be of service?

21:15.440 --> 21:17.100
I long for your instructions.

21:18.240 --> 21:19.970
He's probing for information.

21:25.240 --> 21:26.160
To be honest,

21:26.590 --> 21:30.190
when Nan Heng was busy
dealing with various forces in the palace,

21:30.400 --> 21:31.790
I already took the reigns

21:31.790 --> 21:33.680
of the Waning River Crescent.

21:33.700 --> 21:35.090
So, all you need to do now

21:35.410 --> 21:36.710
is point out a target for me.

21:36.710 --> 21:38.310
Then I'll go after it.

21:38.350 --> 21:40.000
Take me with you on every mission.

21:40.000 --> 21:41.590
You'll surely be benefited.

21:41.590 --> 21:42.760
If I point at the sky,

21:42.790 --> 21:43.850
can you fly up high?

21:44.300 --> 21:45.460
If I point at the earth,

21:45.460 --> 21:47.190
can you burrow into the depths?

21:51.100 --> 21:53.260
This entire world was created by me.

21:53.400 --> 21:55.270
If you want to stay safe and sound,

21:55.460 --> 21:57.180
just remember one thing.

21:59.000 --> 21:59.790
What is it?

22:02.320 --> 22:03.430
That is,

22:07.010 --> 22:08.340
never to ask questions.

22:16.730 --> 22:25.940
[Righteousness]

22:18.310 --> 22:19.770
Don't feel obliged.

22:19.830 --> 22:21.030
It's really late now.

22:21.030 --> 22:22.270
You're not familiar with the mansion,

22:22.270 --> 22:22.830
are you?

22:22.830 --> 22:24.350
Let me walk you out.

22:24.350 --> 22:26.000
No need for this. No need.

22:26.070 --> 22:27.340
How can I trouble you

22:27.370 --> 22:28.350
for such a trifle?

22:28.350 --> 22:30.810
It'll make me
seem inconsiderate, won't it?

22:31.440 --> 22:31.920
Go get some rest!

22:31.920 --> 22:32.240
Okay.

22:32.240 --> 22:34.400
I'm going back then.

22:32.990 --> 22:38.700
[Righteousness]

22:34.920 --> 22:36.030
I'm drunk.

22:36.270 --> 22:37.070
Bye bye!

22:42.310 --> 22:44.080
What

22:44.270 --> 22:46.060
a tight-lipped old man.

23:17.230 --> 23:20.250
[Huaipu Hall]

23:20.400 --> 23:21.700
Off-the-books Qianyu troops?

23:20.700 --> 23:24.390
[Study of Crown Prince's Residence,
at about 9 a.m. to 11 a.m.]

23:21.750 --> 23:22.550
Right.

23:22.550 --> 23:24.440
Fugui checked the plans
of garrison defenses.

23:24.440 --> 23:26.590
There are no records
of Qianyu Army being deployed last night.

23:26.590 --> 23:27.960
Shanhu then asked some friends

23:27.960 --> 23:28.920
in relevant fields,

23:28.920 --> 23:30.110
and found out that those people

23:30.110 --> 23:31.590
were soldiers secretly transferred

23:31.590 --> 23:33.390
from the borders by Chu Guihong.

23:38.070 --> 23:39.240
I recall it now.

23:39.590 --> 23:41.220
According to the script,

23:41.350 --> 23:43.000
after Nan Heng ascends the throne,

23:43.000 --> 23:46.070
the ostracized Chu Guihong comes back
to the capital without permission

23:46.070 --> 23:47.720
and deploys troops in secret,

23:47.720 --> 23:51.160
hence leading to the iconic scene
of choosing one out of the two hostages.

23:51.160 --> 23:51.960
Does it mean

23:53.590 --> 23:55.320
the plots will remain the same?

23:57.030 --> 23:57.830
Don't worry.

23:58.240 --> 23:59.830
We've beaten down our fate once.

23:59.830 --> 24:01.490
We can definitely do it again.

24:01.590 --> 24:03.240
Now, as long as we get hold of the proof

24:03.240 --> 24:05.200
that Chu Guihong
illegally deployed troops,

24:05.200 --> 24:07.130
we can strike first and defeat him.

24:11.310 --> 24:12.240
Are you alright?

24:12.600 --> 24:13.670
I'm fine.

24:14.290 --> 24:16.480
Is Yiting involved
in the next iconic scene

24:16.480 --> 24:17.880
you just mentioned?

24:20.720 --> 24:21.310
Yes.

24:22.110 --> 24:22.880
Listen,

24:23.550 --> 24:25.150
write a letter to your father

24:25.680 --> 24:27.110
and ask him to bring Song Yiting
to the palace.

24:27.110 --> 24:28.510
The palace is heavily guarded.

24:28.510 --> 24:30.970
This might deter
Chu Guihong and his father.

24:31.000 --> 24:33.960
As long as Yiting and you don't show up
on the gate tower at the same time,

24:33.960 --> 24:35.640
they won't be able
to carry out their plan.

24:35.640 --> 24:36.240
Got it.

24:39.360 --> 24:40.530
However...

24:41.350 --> 24:43.880
If Chu Guihong’s reinforcements
have arrived,

24:43.880 --> 24:46.440
I'm afraid the guards
and Xuanjia soldiers in the capital

24:46.440 --> 24:47.640
can't fight them off.

24:49.120 --> 24:50.200
Don't worry.

24:50.590 --> 24:51.880
I'll go meet the Emperor

24:51.880 --> 24:54.570
and ask him to quickly transfer
more Xuanjia soldiers to the capital.

24:54.570 --> 24:55.970
Even if they can't arrive in time,

24:55.970 --> 24:57.200
the Nightwalkers will keep

24:57.200 --> 24:58.860
the palace safe for some time.

24:59.240 --> 25:00.040
Later, can you

25:00.480 --> 25:01.920
tell me in detail

25:02.070 --> 25:03.510
about what will happen

25:03.510 --> 25:05.440
on the day of the next iconic scene?

25:09.350 --> 25:11.640
Only after the iconic scenes
happen as scheduled

25:11.640 --> 25:12.830
can I go back to the modern times

25:12.830 --> 25:14.760
and write a perfect ending for you.

25:21.980 --> 25:23.690
Where is this moth from?

25:25.350 --> 25:26.750
The wind has risen again.

25:28.240 --> 25:29.250
This is

25:30.920 --> 25:32.720
just a new beginning.

25:35.240 --> 25:37.510
Great!

25:37.510 --> 25:38.110
Bravo!

25:39.440 --> 25:40.160
There you go.

25:40.160 --> 25:40.720
Thanks.

25:40.720 --> 25:41.450
Here you are.

25:43.030 --> 25:44.090
Let's go, Jixiang.

25:44.270 --> 25:45.070
To the palace.

25:54.350 --> 25:55.160
General Chu,

25:55.440 --> 25:57.720
I've done what you asked.

26:02.480 --> 26:03.740
Aren't you going to ask

26:05.030 --> 26:06.410
why I'm doing this?

26:10.000 --> 26:12.780
You must have untellable but solid reasons

26:13.000 --> 26:15.070
for taking these moves against the Emperor

26:15.070 --> 26:16.600
and the Eighteenth Prince.

26:17.750 --> 26:18.480
General Chu,

26:19.440 --> 26:20.370
you saved my life

26:21.070 --> 26:22.920
on the battlefield.

26:23.840 --> 26:25.720
At the moment you rescued me,

26:26.590 --> 26:28.200
I already made up my mind

26:28.920 --> 26:29.720
to do anything

26:30.600 --> 26:31.880
you ask me to

26:32.430 --> 26:33.830
in the future.

26:34.590 --> 26:35.990
Even if you tell me to die,

26:38.030 --> 26:40.090
I'll do it without asking a question.

26:41.400 --> 26:42.200
Good.

26:49.830 --> 26:50.840
Rong Hua,

26:51.790 --> 26:52.850
you're the only one

26:53.160 --> 26:54.270
I can trust now.

26:55.310 --> 26:56.110
Remember,

26:56.480 --> 26:57.950
if my father gives you any tasks,

26:57.950 --> 26:59.510
just take on them.

26:59.540 --> 27:00.340
But

27:00.860 --> 27:02.860
you don't have to follow every word.

27:07.830 --> 27:09.000
Physician Qin found

27:09.000 --> 27:11.060
the crown prince just oddly fell ill,

27:11.200 --> 27:13.880
as if he had suddenly
had a drawn-out illness

27:13.880 --> 27:16.000
and suffered from poor blood circulation.

27:16.000 --> 27:18.960
The physicians can't think of
a suitable therapy right now.

27:18.960 --> 27:22.960
They can only make some prescriptions
to help His Highness feel better.

27:24.830 --> 27:27.360
Keep the truth
from the Noble Consort for now.

27:28.490 --> 27:29.300
Your Majesty.

27:30.590 --> 27:31.400
Your Majesty,

27:31.400 --> 27:33.130
the Eighteenth Prince is here.

27:33.590 --> 27:34.440
Let him in.

27:34.640 --> 27:35.350
Yes.

27:40.440 --> 27:41.240
Father.

27:42.030 --> 27:42.830
Father,

27:43.240 --> 27:44.510
I heard Heng got sick.

27:44.510 --> 27:45.750
You must be upset.

27:47.010 --> 27:48.930
I didn't know what I could do to help,

27:48.930 --> 27:51.520
so I bought some red tangerines for you.

27:52.640 --> 27:54.750
Aren't they your mother's favorite?

27:55.030 --> 27:55.830
Yes.

27:56.160 --> 27:58.620
Mother's death anniversary
is in a few days.

27:59.010 --> 28:01.770
Now, you're worried
about Heng's condition.

28:02.080 --> 28:04.110
I thought these red tangerines

28:04.440 --> 28:06.720
could bring you some comfort.

28:09.070 --> 28:10.640
You've really grown up, Rui.

28:10.640 --> 28:12.520
Look how attentive you are now.

28:13.110 --> 28:13.590
Come on.

28:13.720 --> 28:14.510
Sit down.

28:18.440 --> 28:19.240
Father,

28:19.260 --> 28:21.200
let me peel a tangerine for you.

28:21.200 --> 28:21.720
Okay.

28:25.880 --> 28:26.680
Father...

28:27.150 --> 28:28.710
You're a grownup now,

28:28.730 --> 28:30.740
but you can't even peel a tangerine right.

28:30.740 --> 28:31.460
Well...

28:31.550 --> 28:33.260
When Mother was alive,

28:33.440 --> 28:35.480
she'd always peel tangerines for me.

28:35.480 --> 28:36.770
I've never

28:36.830 --> 28:38.560
peeled a tangerine for anyone.

28:48.160 --> 28:49.830
Look how clumsy you are.

28:50.590 --> 28:51.400
Let me peel it.

28:52.920 --> 28:53.550
Okay.

29:04.410 --> 29:05.810
Father, you eat it first.

29:13.720 --> 29:14.520
Tastes sweet.

29:14.950 --> 29:16.840
Only because I bought it.

29:21.750 --> 29:23.510
I feel like you grew up

29:24.270 --> 29:25.720
in just a blink of an eye.

29:27.030 --> 29:28.000
Physically, I'm stronger now.

29:28.000 --> 29:29.880
But intelligently, I'm not.

29:30.350 --> 29:32.750
I did a lot of silly things before

29:32.910 --> 29:35.180
and let you and Mother down.

29:37.000 --> 29:38.590
Saplings can't grow into big trees

29:38.590 --> 29:40.590
without proper cultivation.

29:41.000 --> 29:42.750
Saying that you didn't turn out well

29:42.750 --> 29:45.920
is denying my ability to
act as a decent gardener.

29:48.790 --> 29:49.590
Maybe

29:50.240 --> 29:52.090
I'm not a wise ruler,

29:52.240 --> 29:54.550
but at least I should be a good father.

29:56.000 --> 29:57.930
As long as you are healthy and safe,

29:58.640 --> 29:59.200
I won't

29:59.350 --> 30:01.920
feel ashamed when I meet your mother again

30:02.070 --> 30:04.030
in heaven.

30:04.030 --> 30:04.830
Father,

30:04.850 --> 30:06.030
where-

30:06.030 --> 30:08.090
where is this pessimistic talk from?

30:08.510 --> 30:09.310
Father,

30:09.650 --> 30:11.160
Heng's condition must worry you

30:11.160 --> 30:12.310
so much that you are

30:12.310 --> 30:13.510
feeling too tired, lethargic

30:13.510 --> 30:14.830
and even depressed.

30:15.880 --> 30:16.680
Father,

30:17.670 --> 30:18.730
I've actually

30:18.750 --> 30:21.590
asked the Imperial Astronomical Bureau
in private.

30:21.590 --> 30:22.790
Heng fell ill

30:22.790 --> 30:24.440
probably because he was invaded

30:24.440 --> 30:25.720
by something evil.

30:27.280 --> 30:28.920
To cure him,

30:28.960 --> 30:31.750
we must use the righteousness
deep within our souls

30:31.750 --> 30:33.000
and heartfelt joy

30:33.000 --> 30:35.220
to suppress the evil.

30:35.440 --> 30:36.680
I was going to suggest you

30:36.680 --> 30:37.960
issue an imperial edict

30:37.960 --> 30:39.350
to forbid disheartening remarks

30:39.350 --> 30:40.480
in the palace,

30:40.480 --> 30:41.440
as a way to pray for Heng

30:41.440 --> 30:43.110
and for Great Jing.

30:45.750 --> 30:46.550
Liu Mingxi.

30:47.920 --> 30:50.790
I think I have over ten memorials to read.

30:50.790 --> 30:51.680
Fetch them now.

30:51.700 --> 30:52.340
Yes.

30:56.400 --> 30:58.440
Father, why are you ignoring me?

30:58.460 --> 30:59.720
Did I say anything wrong?

30:59.720 --> 31:00.520
It's not that.

31:00.720 --> 31:02.520
I'm just eating this tangerine.

31:02.550 --> 31:03.310
It's so delicious.

31:03.310 --> 31:04.000
Okay then.

31:04.000 --> 31:04.790
Very tasty.

31:04.790 --> 31:05.560
That's good.

31:06.070 --> 31:06.720
Father,

31:07.110 --> 31:07.920
will you issue

31:07.920 --> 31:09.400
an imperial edict

31:09.400 --> 31:11.330
to draw that evil thing out of Heng?

31:13.440 --> 31:15.280
Father, are you alright?

31:15.590 --> 31:17.400
You must've chocked on that tangerine.

31:17.400 --> 31:18.330
Have some water.

31:23.110 --> 31:24.050
Father,

31:24.480 --> 31:25.880
what's happening to you?

31:32.200 --> 31:32.920
Father.

31:32.940 --> 31:33.790
Father!

31:33.810 --> 31:34.880
Father!

31:34.900 --> 31:35.650
Father!

31:35.720 --> 31:36.590
I'm worried.

31:36.590 --> 31:37.680
Father!

31:37.880 --> 31:39.790
Royal physicians!

31:40.480 --> 31:41.070
Your Majesty!

31:41.070 --> 31:41.400
What's wrong?

31:41.400 --> 31:42.630
I'm frightened!

31:42.920 --> 31:43.920
Guards!

31:43.940 --> 31:45.920
The Eighteenth Prince
poisoned the Emperor!

31:45.920 --> 31:47.030
Help!

31:47.050 --> 31:49.240
The Eighteenth Prince
poisoned the Emperor!

31:49.240 --> 31:50.310
Help!

31:50.310 --> 31:51.030
No.

31:51.270 --> 31:52.070
No.

31:52.090 --> 31:53.310
I didn't.

31:53.510 --> 31:54.390
Father...

31:54.480 --> 31:55.540
Run...

31:56.030 --> 31:57.220
Ask Heng for help...

32:05.680 --> 32:06.540
Your Highness.

32:07.080 --> 32:08.410
Jixiang, Jixiang!

32:08.430 --> 32:09.830
People are chasing after me.

32:09.830 --> 32:11.000
They said I poisoned Father,

32:11.000 --> 32:11.880
but I didn't.

32:11.880 --> 32:13.270
I really didn't!

32:13.270 --> 32:14.000
I know.

32:14.000 --> 32:14.440
Let's go

32:14.440 --> 32:15.310
find the crown prince.

32:15.310 --> 32:15.750
Okay.

32:25.270 --> 32:25.880
Guihong,

32:25.880 --> 32:27.030
you came just in time.

32:27.030 --> 32:28.720
Father somehow got poisoned.

32:28.720 --> 32:30.250
Come with me to check it out.

32:32.200 --> 32:34.110
Qianyu Army is ordered
to defend the sovereign

32:34.110 --> 32:36.510
and seize the culprit
who poisoned the Emperor.

32:36.510 --> 32:37.310
Take him down!

32:37.760 --> 32:39.190
Back off!

32:40.920 --> 32:42.520
Nan Rui, you're the culprit.

32:42.960 --> 32:44.420
Are you defying the order?

32:44.440 --> 32:45.240
I...

32:45.350 --> 32:46.550
He did nothing wrong.

32:46.550 --> 32:47.550
He's not the culprit.

32:47.550 --> 32:49.080
How is he defying the order?

32:49.270 --> 32:50.730
What a stubborn offender.

32:52.510 --> 32:53.480
Qianyu Army

32:53.790 --> 32:55.510
will still carry out its duties.

32:55.510 --> 32:56.910
When swords are wielded,

32:57.160 --> 32:58.090
there may be

32:58.920 --> 33:00.640
bloodshed.

33:02.510 --> 33:03.070
Strike!

33:23.880 --> 33:24.680
Jixiang...

33:25.790 --> 33:26.860
Jixiang.

33:27.070 --> 33:28.190
Jixiang.

33:28.440 --> 33:29.240
Jixiang.

33:30.020 --> 33:31.730
Don't trust Chu Guihong.

33:32.270 --> 33:33.340
Your Highness,

33:33.510 --> 33:35.140
go find the crown prince now.

33:35.170 --> 33:36.240
I know.

33:36.240 --> 33:37.000
I know.

33:37.000 --> 33:38.000
Stop talking.

33:38.070 --> 33:39.320
Where are the royal physicians?

33:39.320 --> 33:40.260
Royal physicians...

33:40.260 --> 33:41.480
Where are the royal physicians?

33:41.480 --> 33:43.040
Get me a royal physician!

33:43.170 --> 33:43.980
Jixiang.

33:44.010 --> 33:44.850
Jixiang!

33:45.000 --> 33:46.110
Let go of me!

33:46.830 --> 33:47.640
Jixiang!

33:47.640 --> 33:48.550
Jixiang!

33:48.580 --> 33:49.690
Please don't die,

33:49.710 --> 33:50.560
Jixiang!

33:50.590 --> 33:52.160
I've lost everything.

33:52.160 --> 33:53.890
You're all I have now, Jixiang!

33:54.550 --> 33:55.620
Jixiang!

33:57.000 --> 33:58.820
Let go of me!

34:00.200 --> 34:01.030
Jixiang!

34:11.110 --> 34:11.920
Guihong...

34:12.590 --> 34:13.480
Why?

34:14.070 --> 34:14.880
Why?

34:15.010 --> 34:17.340
Why are you doing this to me?

34:22.320 --> 34:25.380
Do you have something to do
with Father being poisoned?

34:25.560 --> 34:26.960
Answer me.

34:27.590 --> 34:29.389
Answer me now!

34:29.420 --> 34:31.550
Give me an answer!

34:42.620 --> 34:44.000
Xuanjia Army is here executing

34:44.000 --> 34:46.710
the crown prince's order
to take the Eighteenth Prince away!

34:46.710 --> 34:47.719
General Chu,

34:48.080 --> 34:49.210
free the prince now.

34:57.880 --> 34:58.880
Release him.

35:09.920 --> 35:10.780
Your Highness,

35:11.550 --> 35:12.590
what should we do

35:12.590 --> 35:13.990
in this critical moment?

35:14.280 --> 35:15.880
I beg for your instructions.

35:17.000 --> 35:19.880
The Ministry of Justice has interrogated
the red tangerine vendor.

35:19.880 --> 35:21.840
The eunuchs guarding outside
the Emperor's bed chamber and Liu Mingxi

35:21.840 --> 35:23.170
have all given their statements.

35:23.170 --> 35:24.570
It is proven
that the Eighteenth Prince

35:24.570 --> 35:27.300
personally fed
those tangerines to the Emperor.

35:27.840 --> 35:28.190
This...

35:28.190 --> 35:30.030
This is solid evidence.

35:35.920 --> 35:36.780
Your Highness.

35:38.830 --> 35:40.360
What's the situation like?

35:41.550 --> 35:42.550
Your Highness,

35:42.550 --> 35:44.510
the royal physicians
have carefully examined

35:44.510 --> 35:47.000
the poison found
in the Eighteenth Prince's residence

35:47.000 --> 35:48.320
by Qianyu Army.

35:49.000 --> 35:51.670
It is identical to the poison
in the red tangerines.

35:51.670 --> 35:53.670
I'm asking about the Emperor!

35:55.630 --> 35:57.510
His Majesty is unconscious

35:57.510 --> 35:59.110
with shallow breaths now.

35:59.140 --> 36:00.280
According to Physician Qin,

36:00.280 --> 36:02.030
this poison is highly toxic.

36:02.030 --> 36:02.890
It is likely...

36:03.110 --> 36:05.570
It is likely to endanger
His Majesty's life!

36:07.440 --> 36:08.750
Go tell Physician Qin

36:09.230 --> 36:10.690
to save the Emperor's life

36:10.800 --> 36:12.050
with whatever potent drugs

36:12.050 --> 36:13.510
or by any means necessary.

36:13.670 --> 36:14.710
I'll bear all the consequences

36:14.710 --> 36:15.900
that may lead to.

36:16.560 --> 36:17.650
Yes.

36:20.030 --> 36:21.070
Here comes the crown prince.

36:21.070 --> 36:22.590
Your Highness.

36:22.620 --> 36:23.760
Your Highness!

36:26.110 --> 36:26.970
Your Highness,

36:27.360 --> 36:29.190
there are witnesses
and physical evidence.

36:29.190 --> 36:31.480
The Eighteenth Prince Nan Rui is a rebel
who attempted to murder the Emperor.

36:31.480 --> 36:33.230
This is an unpardonable offense.

36:33.230 --> 36:34.550
Your Highness must punish him severely.

36:34.550 --> 36:35.320
Yes.

36:35.480 --> 36:36.840
The court is in turmoil now.

36:36.840 --> 36:38.300
Danger is lurking around.

36:38.550 --> 36:40.920
Your Highness must
take decisive measures now,

36:40.920 --> 36:42.670
or the court will be mortally disturbed

36:42.670 --> 36:43.230
and the country deeply shaken...

36:43.230 --> 36:43.800
Shut up!

36:52.800 --> 36:54.030
Nan Rui is my brother.

36:54.760 --> 36:55.630
No one knows him

36:55.630 --> 36:57.000
better than I do.

36:59.230 --> 37:00.590
No matter who asks me,

37:01.400 --> 37:03.000
be it an official, a citizen,

37:03.920 --> 37:04.670
or anyone else,

37:04.670 --> 37:06.130
I'll give the same answer.

37:06.880 --> 37:08.590
That is, Nan Rui can't be the culprit.

37:08.590 --> 37:09.440
Do you hear me?

37:10.960 --> 37:11.820
Your Highness,

37:12.190 --> 37:13.990
should the Ministry of Justice

37:14.590 --> 37:16.230
investigate this case or not?

37:16.230 --> 37:17.550
Keep investigating it,

37:17.550 --> 37:19.080
till the truth is revealed.

37:19.280 --> 37:19.960
Yes.

37:23.630 --> 37:25.360
What are the odds?

37:26.440 --> 37:28.240
Shortly after Nan Heng fell ill,

37:29.280 --> 37:30.740
the Emperor was poisoned.

37:31.150 --> 37:33.230
How could it have been done by Nan Rui?

37:37.920 --> 37:38.780
Your Highness!

37:42.320 --> 37:44.710
The royal kitchen
has sent you food three times.

37:44.710 --> 37:46.440
Please eat something.

37:46.590 --> 37:48.190
No, I don't have an appetite.

37:48.480 --> 37:50.140
There must be hidden secrets.

37:52.360 --> 37:53.770
Even so,

37:53.920 --> 37:55.070
you can't proceed with the case

37:55.070 --> 37:56.760
with an empty stomach.

37:57.360 --> 37:59.290
Word from the royal medical office

37:59.290 --> 38:02.130
says the Emperor might die tonight.

38:02.320 --> 38:03.670
When the crown prince ascends the throne,

38:03.670 --> 38:05.280
there will be many issues

38:05.280 --> 38:07.010
for Your Highness to attend to.

38:07.400 --> 38:08.530
Ascend the throne?

38:09.030 --> 38:10.760
How could I forget about this?

38:11.230 --> 38:12.960
By the time the hostage situation happens,

38:12.960 --> 38:14.960
Nan Heng has become the new emperor.

38:15.070 --> 38:15.920
Nan Heng!

38:15.100 --> 38:21.980
[A Dream of Qingning]
[Scene 19, Episode 37]

38:16.230 --> 38:17.230
You don't deserve the throne

38:17.230 --> 38:18.000
for persecuting faithful officials

38:18.000 --> 38:19.360
and committing regicide and patricide!

38:19.360 --> 38:21.440
If you want to save these women,

38:21.840 --> 38:23.770
then take your own life right here!

38:24.710 --> 38:26.110
How dare you threaten me?

38:29.880 --> 38:30.670
Zhixia,

38:30.690 --> 38:31.840
where is Shangguan He?

38:31.840 --> 38:34.030
He has gone to the Song Residence
to pick up Miss Yiting.

38:34.030 --> 38:35.230
Have someone deliver him a message.

38:35.230 --> 38:36.480
Tell him to protect Yiting

38:36.480 --> 38:37.400
and to stay close to her.

38:37.400 --> 38:38.280
Do you get it?

38:38.440 --> 38:39.110
Go do it now!

38:39.110 --> 38:39.800
Yes.

38:43.150 --> 38:43.960
Yingqiu,

38:44.400 --> 38:45.760
go borrow a Xuanjia troop for me.

38:45.760 --> 38:47.070
I have something to do outside the palace.

38:47.070 --> 38:47.810
Yes.

39:28.920 --> 39:29.710
Jixiang...

39:31.480 --> 39:32.480
couldn't make it.

39:35.150 --> 39:36.210
As for the Emperor,

39:37.920 --> 39:39.720
Physician Qin has done his best.

39:42.230 --> 39:43.030
I'm afraid

39:46.070 --> 39:48.270
Father won't make it through the night.

39:55.760 --> 39:57.290
I believe you are innocent.

39:58.070 --> 40:00.670
I'll also get to the bottom
of this case for you.

40:00.840 --> 40:02.370
But before the truth is out,

40:03.070 --> 40:04.280
you must stay here,

40:05.150 --> 40:07.150
in case anyone stirs up chaos again.

40:08.110 --> 40:08.920
Do you hear me?

40:25.230 --> 40:26.800
It is you who caused

40:27.000 --> 40:28.440
this dire situation.

40:29.760 --> 40:30.630
Who are you showing

40:30.630 --> 40:33.070
this self-defeating attitude to?

40:38.710 --> 40:39.510
Heng.

40:43.510 --> 40:44.320
Don't go.

40:49.440 --> 40:51.150
You gave me advice before.

40:53.760 --> 40:56.000
So did Jixiang.

40:58.070 --> 41:00.590
But I still chose to believe Guihong.

41:03.230 --> 41:04.630
What happened in the end?

41:06.800 --> 41:08.590
Father is dying because of me.

41:10.910 --> 41:13.200
Jixiang lost his life also because of me.

41:16.320 --> 41:17.550
They are the ones

41:17.550 --> 41:19.190
who care most about me.

41:20.080 --> 41:21.150
Don't you think

41:23.070 --> 41:25.230
I should just die?

41:32.800 --> 41:34.360
At this point,

41:35.190 --> 41:37.440
what's the use of saying all this?

41:38.030 --> 41:39.230
Will the situation be improved

41:39.230 --> 41:40.890
because you beat yourself up?

41:47.440 --> 41:48.590
What can I do now?

41:49.440 --> 41:50.230
Look at me.

41:51.770 --> 41:53.910
I'm a giant failure!

41:54.070 --> 41:56.010
A giant failure!

41:56.340 --> 41:57.730
I've never

41:58.110 --> 41:59.630
accomplished anything in my life.

41:59.630 --> 42:01.510
I've never done anything right.

42:01.510 --> 42:02.880
I'm stupid and ignorant.

42:02.880 --> 42:04.880
I caused Jixiang's death.

42:04.880 --> 42:06.190
Father is dying because of me.

42:06.190 --> 42:07.590
Why must they die?

42:07.590 --> 42:08.800
Shouldn't I be the one to die?

42:08.800 --> 42:09.590
Why?

42:09.590 --> 42:10.400
Why?

42:10.400 --> 42:11.150
Why?

42:11.150 --> 42:13.440
Why? Why? Why?

42:13.440 --> 42:15.230
Why must they die?

42:15.230 --> 42:16.190
Why?

42:16.190 --> 42:17.510
Why?

42:26.360 --> 42:28.520
Would anything change if you died?

42:30.230 --> 42:32.230
Could it bring Jixiang back to life?

42:32.400 --> 42:34.070
Could it cure Father?

42:35.630 --> 42:36.890
Listen, Nan Rui.

42:38.000 --> 42:40.130
If there's any resolution left in you,

42:41.190 --> 42:43.150
then pull yourself together

42:43.440 --> 42:44.360
and stand with me

42:44.360 --> 42:45.490
to solve the crisis.

42:47.480 --> 42:48.280
But...

42:51.630 --> 42:53.590
I'm seen as a perpetrator now.

42:55.180 --> 42:56.770
What exactly can I do?

43:00.190 --> 43:01.550
All you need to do now

43:02.440 --> 43:03.800
is think about

43:04.630 --> 43:06.230
if there has been anything suspicious

43:06.230 --> 43:07.510
since you bought the red tangerines,

43:07.510 --> 43:09.310
so you can prove your innocence.

43:09.840 --> 43:10.600
What's more,

43:11.960 --> 43:13.400
I need you now.

43:14.880 --> 43:16.740
I need you to work the problems out

43:17.440 --> 43:19.770
and to bring Father
back to health with me.

43:20.150 --> 43:21.210
Do you understand?

43:27.110 --> 43:27.920
Heng,

43:29.470 --> 43:30.800
can I make it?

43:38.030 --> 43:40.230
You're a prince of Great Jing

43:41.510 --> 43:42.550
and my brother.

43:46.800 --> 43:48.360
I believe you can make it.

43:51.130 --> 43:52.210
Do you hear me?
